  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large 12-inch skillet over medium heat. Add the onion and peppers.",
    "Cook for 6 to 7 minutes, stirring often, until the vegetables are soft and the onion is lightly golden.",
    "Crumble the tofu into the skillet with your hands into small, bite-size pieces.",
    "Add the cumin, garlic powder, turmeric, salt, and pepper. Stir to coat the tofu evenly in yellow.",
    "Cook for 6 to 8 minutes, stirring now and then, until the tofu is hot and any liquid in the pan has cooked off.",
    "Warm the tortillas one at a time in a dry pan over medium heat for 20 to 30 seconds per side, until soft and pliable.",
    "Spoon the scramble into the tortillas and top with avocado slices. Serve right away."
